<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Linens 'n Things, Bed Bath cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Linens 'n Things, Bed Bath cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Aram Rubinson downgraded Linens 'n Things Inc to neutral from attractive and cut Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Linens 'n Things posted a second quarter profit of $0.05 per share, compared with a net loss of $0.02 a share a year ago.</p>
</text>
